#: ../../source/evaluation/case-analysis.md:1 26e2b84228964a4eb0b046be583725cf
msgid "学生个体案例分析"
msgstr "Individual Student Case Analysis"

#: ../../source/evaluation/case-analysis.md:3 adf2fe9332a94dcaaae51462ed364a9d
msgid ""
"本指南介绍如何在模型训练完成后，使用 UniKT "
"的案例分析工具（`case_analysis.py`）对单个学生的答题序列及知识状态演变进行细粒度微观诊断，通过标准的三步工作流生成知识掌握度热力图。"
msgstr ""
"This guide demonstrates how to perform fine-grained micro-level "
"diagnostics on individual students' response sequences and knowledge "
"state trajectories using UniKT's case analysis tool (`case_analysis.py`),"
" generating mastery state heatmaps via a standardized three-step "
"workflow."

#: ../../source/evaluation/case-analysis.md:5 76544143069644ce8bec6265b8a5b885
msgid "目标与适用场景"
msgstr "Objectives & Use Cases"

#: ../../source/evaluation/case-analysis.md:7 6ce26be1f26f4a9c9b672799bfca39a7
msgid "诊断模型在微观层面的预测行为：模型在哪些题目上给出了高置信度的错误预测，在哪些知识点上出现了震荡。"
msgstr ""
"Diagnosing micro-level predictive behavior: identifying which items "
"yielded high-confidence erroneous predictions and which concepts "
"exhibited oscillations."

#: ../../source/evaluation/case-analysis.md:8 f1a4a633dab34c0fb41da4d7f1321103
msgid "可视化学生在整条答题时间线上针对各个知识概念的掌握概率变化轨迹。"
msgstr ""
"Visualizing students' mastery probability trajectories across various "
"knowledge concepts over their full response timelines."

#: ../../source/evaluation/case-analysis.md:9 941886169fd54cc0b055fe3f89896aa3
msgid "对比不同能力水平学生（高表现、低表现、多样性抽样）的认知状态差异。"
msgstr ""
"Comparing cognitive state differences across students of diverse "
"proficiency levels (high-performing, low-performing, and diverse "
"sampling)."

#: ../../source/evaluation/case-analysis.md:11 f543d4f2b13747be9083392cfcbd33c9
msgid "前置条件"
msgstr "Prerequisites"

#: ../../source/evaluation/case-analysis.md:13 4af5e70fed7c4e5089bb4f6a9b832706
msgid "**环境准备**：已进入 Pixi 环境（`pixi shell`）。"
msgstr "**Environment**: Pixi environment activated (`pixi shell`)."

#: ../../source/evaluation/case-analysis.md:14 6f1657e6eb6d40739f45f625bb7b3740
msgid ""
"**已完成模型训练**：存在至少一个已训练好的实验运行目录（包含 `run_config.yaml` 与检查点 "
"`best_model.pth`）。例如："
msgstr ""
"**Trained Model Ready**: At least one trained run directory exists "
"(containing `run_config.yaml` and checkpoint `best_model.pth`). For "
"example:"

#: ../../source/evaluation/case-analysis.md:15 89988a228b3a465fb8559e13a591dc84
msgid "runs/normal/GIKT_assistments09_20261109-120000_fold0_bs128/\n"
msgstr "runs/normal/GIKT_assistments09_20261109-120000_fold0_bs128/\n"

#: ../../source/evaluation/case-analysis.md:19 ac856c9c4edb43c1b8a6fc13fba31d6f
msgid "三步分析工作流"
msgstr "Three-Step Analysis Workflow"

#: ../../source/evaluation/case-analysis.md:21 9cc2b2307f334d678ade2e0d23394c2e
msgid "案例分析包含三个依序执行的步骤："
msgstr "Case analysis comprises three sequential steps:"

#: ../../source/evaluation/case-analysis.md:23 ac639f73fbdc4a3bb2d9afa4473409ae
msgid "**`inference` 批量推断**：加载已训练权重并遍历验证集或测试集，导出全量答题预测与学生统计指标。"
msgstr ""
"**`inference` Batch Inference**: Load trained weights and iterate over "
"the validation or test set, exporting complete response predictions and "
"student summary statistics."

#: ../../source/evaluation/case-analysis.md:24 02912c97d96444158c603d7ef9c9fff4
msgid "**`select` 策略抽样**：按照预设的多样性或极端值策略筛选代表性学生，输出候选学生列表 JSON。"
msgstr ""
"**`select` Strategic Sampling**: Filter representative students according"
" to preset diversity or extreme-case strategies, outputting a candidate "
"JSON list."

#: ../../source/evaluation/case-analysis.md:25 650bbba79df64d0d878d739022353adf
msgid "**`plot` 状态可视化**：读取筛选出的学生交互序列，绘制知识掌握状态演变热力图并保存为 PNG 图像。"
msgstr ""
"**`plot` State Visualization**: Read filtered student interaction "
"sequences, plot knowledge mastery trajectory heatmaps, and save them as "
"PNG images."

#: ../../source/evaluation/case-analysis.md:27 bf81dfef306d4b5fb7116fafeb7f5440
msgid "第一步：批量推理"
msgstr "Step 1: Batch Inference"

#: ../../source/evaluation/case-analysis.md:29 8ee69d6f51f24fc99e86ad61d8d8ddca
msgid "加载已训练模型的检查点，遍历验证集或测试集数据进行前向推断，生成全量答题预测与学生级汇总指标："
msgstr ""
"Load checkpoints of a trained model, iterate through validation or test "
"set data for forward inference, and generate complete response "
"predictions and student-level summaries:"

#: ../../source/evaluation/case-analysis.md:31 167db2eb0ce2403194a7e32fb3fb5db3
msgid ""
"python case_analysis.py inference \\\n"
"  --case.run_dir "
"runs/normal/GIKT_assistments09_20261109-120000_fold0_bs128\n"
msgstr ""
"python case_analysis.py inference \\\n"
"  --case.run_dir "
"runs/normal/GIKT_assistments09_20261109-120000_fold0_bs128\n"

