"`predictions.parquet`：逐条交互的详细预测记录，包含 "
"`user_id`、`question_id`、`skill`、`label`、`prediction` 与 `position` 等字段。"
msgstr ""
"`predictions.parquet`: Detailed per-interaction prediction records "
"including fields such as `user_id`, `question_id`, `skill`, `label`, "
"`prediction`, and `position`."

#: ../../source/evaluation/case-analysis.md:44 954c9a98060847ebb1b1a013da8ebfd4
msgid "`user_summaries.parquet`：按学生汇总的统计特征，涵盖答题次数、正确率、错误率与平均置信度。"
msgstr ""
"`user_summaries.parquet`: Aggregated statistical metrics per student, "
"covering interaction count, accuracy, error rate, and average confidence."

#: ../../source/evaluation/case-analysis.md:46 d0abf5d6199d4233bbbcd686a7138260
msgid "第二步：筛选代表性学生"
msgstr "Step 2: Filter Representative Students"

#: ../../source/evaluation/case-analysis.md:48 8b4fe036214f40fc91d5689d485e63c9
msgid "知识追踪数据集通常包含数千至数万名学生，逐一绘图既不现实也不利于定性分析。通过 `select` 子命令根据特定分析策略筛选代表性学生子集："
msgstr ""
"Knowledge tracing datasets typically contain thousands to tens of "
"thousands of students; plotting every individual is neither practical nor"
" conducive to qualitative insights. The `select` subcommand filters "
"representative student subsets based on specific analysis strategies:"

#: ../../source/evaluation/case-analysis.md:50 3bed2a80fdff4defb1fbdb1297a99c83
msgid ""
"python case_analysis.py select \\\n"
"  --case.run_dir "
"runs/normal/GIKT_assistments09_20261109-120000_fold0_bs128 \\\n"
"  --case.selector diverse \\\n"
"  --case.num_users 10\n"
msgstr ""
"python case_analysis.py select \\\n"
"  --case.run_dir "
"runs/normal/GIKT_assistments09_20261109-120000_fold0_bs128 \\\n"
"  --case.selector diverse \\\n"
"  --case.num_users 10\n"

#: ../../source/evaluation/case-analysis.md:57 ae67e5309d804429ac5395c9d1c192bf
msgid "筛选策略 --case.selector"
msgstr "Sampling Strategy --case.selector"

#: ../../source/evaluation/case-analysis.md:59 71945eb2a3cb4e4aab917e639e31c386
msgid ""
"**`diverse` 多样性采样（默认）**： 将候选学生按错误率从低到高切分为极低、低、中、高、极高 5 "
"个区间，从每个区间均匀抽取，确保抽样样本能覆盖不同认知水平的学生群体。"
msgstr ""
"**`diverse` Diversity Sampling (Default)**: Divides candidate students "
"into 5 quantiles from low to high error rates (very low, low, medium, "
"high, very high) and samples uniformly across each bucket, ensuring "
"samples span varying cognitive proficiency levels."

#: ../../source/evaluation/case-analysis.md:61 552348a14a4f4dddb2110ce8a223096d
msgid "**`extreme` 极端案例**： 筛选错误率最高或置信度偏差最严重的极端学生，专门用于分析模型的失效模式。"
msgstr ""
"**`extreme` Extreme Cases**: Selects extreme students with the highest "
"error rates or most severe confidence deviations, tailored for failure "
"mode analysis."

#: ../../source/evaluation/case-analysis.md:63 d1685f9460d74753836b6664fb17023a
msgid "**`random` 随机抽样**： 在满足序列长度与置信度过滤门槛的学生集合中进行等概率随机采样。"
msgstr ""
"**`random` Uniform Random**: Performs uniform random sampling among "
"student cohorts satisfying sequence length and confidence thresholds."

