#: ../../source/evaluation/case-analysis.md:121
#: b80987fa773e458aac5dee7db7ec6005
msgid "**水平横轴**：答题交互的时间步序列。每个步长标明了当前作答的题目或知识点。"
msgstr ""
"**Horizontal X-axis**: Sequence of response interaction timesteps. Each "
"step indicates the current question or skill attempted."

#: ../../source/evaluation/case-analysis.md:122
#: 307eeb413a2d4c4199eebdfc441a15db
msgid "**垂直纵轴**：数据集中相关的知识概念。"
msgstr "**Vertical Y-axis**: Relevant knowledge concepts in the dataset."

#: ../../source/evaluation/case-analysis.md:123
#: 024f5b8f44474dfbb661f72545579605
msgid ""
"**颜色深浅**：代表模型预测该学生在当前时间步对特定知识点的掌握程度概率值，范围 0.0 至 "
"1.0。颜色越深表示模型推断该学生对该概念掌握程度越高。"
msgstr ""
"**Color Intensity**: Represents the model's predicted mastery probability"
" of the student on a specific concept at the current timestep, ranging "
"from 0.0 to 1.0. Darker colors indicate higher inferred mastery."

#: ../../source/evaluation/case-analysis.md:124
#: d6a93c3295304b10a8fa94a477aaf75b
msgid "**作答标记**："
msgstr "**Response Markers**:"

#: ../../source/evaluation/case-analysis.md:125
#: 0b64e61b4f6d427eb039228de89f1fdf
msgid "绿色标记：学生实际作答正确，Label 为 1。"
msgstr "Green marker: Student answered correctly, Label = 1."

#: ../../source/evaluation/case-analysis.md:126
#: ba27246a5c414f3ebd93403464604aa2
msgid "红色标记：学生实际作答错误，Label 为 0。"
msgstr "Red marker: Student answered incorrectly, Label = 0."

#: ../../source/evaluation/case-analysis.md:129
#: ab9ea04a01ce4d129b53e3abe3d15e87
msgid "通过观察连续做错某类题目时对应知识点颜色的变化，可以直观检验模型是否具备合理的“遗忘”或“负反馈修正”能力；当学生连续答对时，可以观察到知识状态的快速攀升。"
msgstr ""
"By observing color changes across concepts during consecutive incorrect "
"attempts, one can visually verify whether the model exhibits plausible "
"\"forgetting\" or \"negative feedback correction\"; conversely, rapid "
"rises in mastery are visible when students answer consecutive questions "
"correctly."
